      "title": "補常數",
      "prompt": "$\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "int-027",
      "steps": [
        "裡面那一層是 $1+x^2$，它的導數 $2x$ 在分子出現（差一個 $2$）。令 $u=1+x^2$。",
        "$du=2x\\,dx$，所以 $x\\,dx=\\frac{du}{2}$。",
        "$\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot\\frac{du}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{du}{u}$。",
        "$=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln|u|+C=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$。（$1+x^2$ 永遠是正的，絕對值可以拿掉。）",
        "檢查：$\\frac{d}{dx}\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}=\\frac{x}{1+x^2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$",
      "claim": "D((1/2)*ln(1+x^2)) == x/(1+x^2)"
    },
