        "$du=3x^2\\,dx$，所以 $x^2\\,dx=\\frac{du}{3}$。",
        "$\\int\\sqrt{u}\\,\\frac{du}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}\\int u^{1/2}\\,du=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{3}u^{3/2}$。",
